秦惠王卒。二十三年，與秦撃敗楚於重丘。二十四年，秦使涇陽君質於齊。二十五年，歸涇陽君于秦。孟嘗君薛文入秦，卽相秦。文亡去。二十六年，齊與韓魏共攻秦，至函谷軍焉。二十八年，秦與韓河外以和，兵罷。二十九年，趙殺其主父。齊佐趙滅中山。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為、繼位及局部事件暫接；姜齊與田齊桓公、不同時段未名王及同字忌分開。孫子不先補孫臏，子守髙唐不補闕字，索隱短稱與代詞仍待核；未跨篇按同名接人。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p043","text":"十三年，秦惠王卒。二十三年，與秦撃敗楚於重丘。二十四年，秦使涇陽君質於齊。二十五年，歸涇陽君于秦。孟嘗君薛文入秦，卽相秦。文亡去。二十六年，齊與韓魏共攻秦，至函谷軍焉。二十八年，秦與韓河外以和，兵罷。二十九年，趙殺其主父。齊佐趙滅中山。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m043-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"秦惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"an9_1k7_get","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m043-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"涇陽君","kind":"person","person_id":"hzc_zln_xl1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m043-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"涇陽君","kind":"person","person_id":"hzc_zln_xl1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m043-0049","start":49,"end":54,"surface":"孟嘗君薛文","kind":"person","person_id":"54k_feb_3iw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m043-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"文","kind":"person","person_id":"54k_feb_3iw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m043-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"bcz_ap5_p19","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-046","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian","source":{"title":"史記／卷046","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷046","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷046&oldid=2560838","revision_id":2560838,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"55段正文（含太史公論贊）及1段索隱述贊，後者另標witness_appended_suoyin_zan；排除2個dd導覽及現代分節標題。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","lice